diff --git a/DOCS/man/input.rst b/DOCS/man/input.rst
--- a/DOCS/man/input.rst
+++ b/DOCS/man/input.rst
@@ -2724,7 +2724,11 @@
 ``video-params``
     Video parameters, as output by the decoder (with overrides like aspect
     etc. applied). This has a number of sub-properties:
+
+    ``video-params/dolby-vision``
+        Whether decoded video frame side data contains Dolby Vision metadata
+        or an RPU. This is detected from decoded frames, not container tags.
 
     ``video-params/pixelformat``
         The pixel format as string. This uses the same names as used in other
         places of mpv.
